### Cosmic-ray muons (both charges, all energies) through the setup of
### DetectorConstruction.cc; ROOT output, events that only crossed air are skipped.
### 1e6 muons on the 3 x 3 m plane at z = 75 cm ~ 14 min of live time.

/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 1
/OutputDirectory output
/OutputFile cosmic
/gun/seed 1

/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 75 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX 150 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY 150 cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 75 deg
/tof/cosmic/energyMin 0 GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax 1000 GeV
/tof/cosmic/charge both

/run/beamOn 1000000
